-lennon-salute-to-sir-lew-the-master-showman/\">Television: John Lennon on Salute To Sir Lew – The Master Showman</a></li><li>1975: <a href=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/1975/04/18/uk-single-release-stand-by-me-john-lennon/\">UK single release: Stand By Me by John Lennon</a></li><li>1973: <a href=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/1973/04/18/mixing-wings-over-europe-tour-3/\">Mixing: Wings Over Europe Tour</a></li><li>1972: <a href=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/1972/04/18/john-lennon-yoko-ono-attend-us-immigration-hearing-2/\">John Lennon and Yoko Ono attend US immigration hearing</a></li><li>1971: <a href=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/1971/04/18/travel-john-lennon-london-brive-la-gaillarde/\">Travel: John Lennon –&nbsp;London to Brive-la-Gaillarde</a></li><li>1969: <a href=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/1969/04/18/recording-mixing-old-brown-shoe-i-want-you-shes-so-heavy/\">Recording, mixing: Old Brown Shoe, I Want You (She’s So Heavy)</a></li><li>1966: <a href=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/1966/04/18/lennon-and-harrison-watch-the-lovin-spoonful-in-london/\">Lennon and Harrison watch The Lovin’ Spoonful in London</a></li><li>1965: <a href=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/1965/04/18/mixing-help-the-night-before/\">Mixing: Help!, The Night Before</a></li><li>1964: <a href=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/1964/04/18/recording-around-the-beatles/\">Recording: Around The Beatles</a></li><li>1964: <a href=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/1964/04/18/filming-a-hard-days-night-35/\">Filming: A Hard Day’s Night</a></li><li>1963: <a href=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/1963/04/18/paul-mccartney-meets-jane-asher/\">Paul McCartney meets Jane Asher</a></li><li>1962: <a href=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/1962/04/18/live-star-club-hamburg-6/\">The Beatles live: Star-Club, Hamburg</a></li><li>1961: <a href=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/1961/04/18/live-top-ten-club-hamburg-18/\">The Beatles live: Top Ten Club, Hamburg</a></li></ul><p>Want more? Visit the <a title=\"Day after day: the Beat