  "textContent": "A new video for Ringo Starr’s song Give More Love has been released. The promo clip shows Starr and his band performing the song, as well as fan-submitted photos.Give More Love is the title track of Starr’s 19th studio album, released on 15 September 2017. It features contributions from Paul McCartney, Joe Walsh, Dave Stuart, Steve Lukather, Peter Frampton and others.\n\n\n\nPage last updated: 4 May 2018Also on this day...2024: Paul McCartney and Wings’ One Hand Clapping to be released on 14 June2003: Paul McCartney live: Earls Court Exhibition Centre, London1975: Television: John Lennon on Salute To Sir Lew – The Master Showman1975: UK single release: Stand By Me by John Lennon1973: Mixing: Wings Over Europe Tour1972: John Lennon and Yoko Ono attend US immigration hearing1971: Travel: John Lennon – London to Brive-la-Gaillarde1969: Recording, mixing: Old Brown Shoe, I Want You (She’s So Heavy)1966: Lennon and Harrison watch The Lovin’ Spoonful in London1965: Mixing: Help!, The Night Before1964: Recording: Around The Beatles1964: Filming: A Hard Day’s Night1963: Paul McCartney meets Jane Asher1962: The Beatles live: Star-Club, Hamburg1961: The Beatles live: Top Ten Club, HamburgWant more? Visit the Beatles history section.",
